---
title: "releaseVestedTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_vesting: caller releases vested tokens
    q_check_vesting --> q_call_release: position.vestingAddress != address(0)
    q_check_vesting --> q_revert_no_vesting: no vesting contract
    q_call_release --> [*]: vestingContract.release(), emit VestedTokensReleased(investor, vestingAddress)
    q_revert_no_vesting --> [*]: revert NoVestingContract

    note right of q_call_release
        INV-001: Release amount determined by vesting schedule and elapsed time
        INV-002: Tokens transferred from vesting contract directly to investor
    end note
